1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,075
We pushed convenience to its absolute limit: you don't even have to open the app.

2
00:00:05,025 --> 00:00:11,787
On both iPhone lock screens and home screens, you can place dedicated PNCC Care status widgets.

3
00:00:11,787 --> 00:00:17,625
The widgets feature clean color rings and status labels showing whether mom or dad has checked in.

4
00:00:17,625 --> 00:00:25,162
When a deadline is approaching, the Dynamic Island on modern iPhones displays a live status capsule with a countdown timer.

5
00:00:25,162 --> 00:00:30,737
Whether you're reading emails or browsing the web, a quick glance gives you total peace of mind.

